# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Market split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Masalah Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The market split problem is a real-world, NP-hard resource allocation problem and has become a benchmark for quantum optimization algorithms.\n"
"It represents a high-stakes logistical challenge: how to partition a complex landscape of customers and products into manageable, equalized territories.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah market split adalah masalah peruntukan sumber dunia sebenar yang NP-hard dan telah menjadi penanda aras bagi algoritma pengoptimuman kuantum.\n"
"Ia mewakili cabaran logistik bertaruhan tinggi: bagaimana untuk membahagikan landskap kompleks pelanggan dan produk kepada wilayah yang boleh diurus dan seimbang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The goal is to divide $n$ markets into two balanced sales regions such that each region receives exactly half the total demand for $m$ products.\n"
"The solution is the specific configuration that achieves the most even distribution of product demand possible, allowing a company to implement a logistics and staffing strategy where both regions are balanced,\n"
"minimizing the risks such as localized product shortages or warehouse overflows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Matlamatnya adalah untuk membahagikan $n$ pasaran kepada dua wilayah jualan yang seimbang sedemikian rupa sehingga setiap wilayah menerima tepat separuh daripada jumlah permintaan untuk $m$ produk.\n"
"Penyelesaiannya ialah konfigurasi khusus yang mencapai taburan permintaan produk yang paling sekata yang mungkin, membolehkan sesebuah syarikat melaksanakan strategi logistik dan kakitangan di mana kedua-dua wilayah seimbang,\n"
"meminimumkan risiko seperti kekurangan produk tempatan atau limpahan gudang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the number of markets and products increases, the number of possible permutations grows exponentially, making it challenging to find the best split using traditional exhaustive searches.\n"
msgstr "Apabila bilangan pasaran dan produk meningkat, bilangan kemungkinan permutasi berkembang secara eksponen, menjadikannya sukar untuk mencari pembahagian terbaik menggunakan carian menyeluruh tradisional.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mathematical formulation {#mathematical-formulation}"
msgstr "Perumusan Matematik {#mathematical-formulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let $A$ be an $m \\times n$ matrix representing the demand of products across markets, where $A_{ij}$ is the demand for product $i$ in market $j$.\n"
msgstr "Biar $A$ menjadi matriks $m \\times n$ yang mewakili permintaan produk merentasi pasaran, di mana $A_{ij}$ ialah permintaan untuk produk $i$ di pasaran $j$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A binary assignment vector, $x = [x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n]^T \\in \\{0, 1\\}^n$, is defined where:\n"
"* $x_j = 1$ assigns market $j$ to Region A.\n"
"* $x_j = 0$ assigns market $j$ to Region B.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vektor penugasan binari, $x = [x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n]^T \\in \\{0, 1\\}^n$, ditakrifkan di mana:\n"
"* $x_j = 1$ menugaskan pasaran $j$ kepada Wilayah A.\n"
"* $x_j = 0$ menugaskan pasaran $j$ kepada Wilayah B.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let $d = [d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_m]^T$ be the total demand vector for each product, calculated as $d = A \\cdot \\mathbf{1}$. The target sales volume per region for product $i$ is exactly $\\frac{d_i}{2}$.\n"
msgstr "Biar $d = [d_1, d_2, \\dots, d_m]^T$ menjadi vektor jumlah permintaan untuk setiap produk, dikira sebagai $d = A \\cdot \\mathbf{1}$. Volum jualan sasaran bagi setiap wilayah untuk produk $i$ adalah tepat $\\frac{d_i}{2}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimization or feasibility constraint requires that the total sales allocated to Region A perfectly matches half the total demand for every product:\n"
msgstr "Kekangan pengoptimuman atau kebolehlaksanaan memerlukan jumlah jualan yang diperuntukkan kepada Wilayah A sepadan sepenuhnya dengan separuh daripada jumlah permintaan untuk setiap produk:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$A x = \\frac{1}{2} A \\mathbf{1} = b.$$\n"
msgstr "$$A x = \\frac{1}{2} A \\mathbf{1} = b.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In practice, because exact division is rarely possible, the problem is formulated to minimize the squared constraint violation (the cost function):\n"
msgstr "Dalam praktiknya, oleh kerana pembahagian yang tepat jarang mungkin, masalah ini dirumuskan untuk meminimumkan pelanggaran kekangan yang dikuasa duakan (fungsi kos):\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\min_{x} \\left\\Vert{} A x - b \\right\\Vert{}^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( \\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij} x_j - b\\right)^2.$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\min_{x} \\left\\Vert{} A x - b \\right\\Vert{}^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( \\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij} x_j - b\\right)^2.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expanding this gives a form that is equivalent to a quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problem.\n"
msgstr "Mengembangkan ini memberikan bentuk yang setara dengan masalah pengoptimuman binari tanpa kekangan kuadratik (QUBO).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upon solving, the solution vector $x$ dictates to which region the market is assigned. This is the configuration that achieves the most balanced distribution of product demand possible.\n"
msgstr "Setelah diselesaikan, vektor penyelesaian $x$ menentukan kepada wilayah mana pasaran tersebut ditugaskan. Ini adalah konfigurasi yang mencapai taburan permintaan produk yang paling seimbang yang mungkin.\n"

